# pywebview and its dependencies, installed into the repo so `tools/run_ui.py`
# can open a native window without touching the runtime's site-packages.
# Regenerate with: <python> -m pip install --target _vendor pywebview
_vendor/
# PyInstaller, installed into the repo only to answer can this ship as an exe.
